                "Comment on this scale": {
                    "key": "ScaleComment",
                    "value": "The Indian grama scale as conceptualized by E. J. Arnold.\nPublication: ‘L'intonation juste dans la théorie ancienne de l'Inde : les applications aux musiques modale et harmonique’. Revue de Musicologie, vol. 71c n° 1-2, 1985, p. 11-38. Edited and translated by Bernard Bel\nThis version has been modified to define 22 notes on 23 intervals: it has no \"m4\" (Ma tivra + pramana shruti).\n"
                }
